{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/f210osfkwp7rcjpk2sodabk2whf8sir.mp3","text":"只要是我能做的工作，都可以交给我。我来这里，就是为了让你多休息一下，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/5x6p9gonbfdhyta1vl9l00r4ezbl3lc.mp3","text":"我的病，不算什么。偶尔很痛，但我能忍住。博士，我一定要继续工作。我不想让大家对我失望。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/37jmrb83swf0b0l1i461etiw8o0uczq.mp3","text":"点心，都吃完了。啊......是博士一周的量？抱歉......下午茶的话，我来做奶酪火锅吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/du8e0e4i6nv8emmqpz3cxzcfrl4k5mb.mp3","text":"在走廊上撞见银灰老爷和圣女大人的时候，我还是会忍不住行礼。可是他们说，在罗德岛，我应该把他们当成同事。我......努力试试。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/cuknjer360iw8wkchw9gm9q1otyt6g7.mp3","text":"我......做不了探险家。比起探索，我更想守护。桩子打下去，家园建起来。像你们这样不断前行的人，还是需要有人替你们守着后方阵地的吧？博士，我想做那个人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/s2t1uhwzw9sfg6srrx2z5m7ktmney29.mp3","text":"银灰老爷说，谢拉格，不能永远依靠耶拉冈德，更不能依靠其他国家。我希望，有一天，我也能用手中的盾，为家人们抵挡风雪。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/hg41pmunr5cscp4g9axmsfit9aith2q.mp3","text":"我常常梦见雪山，梦见......我在结了厚冰的湖面上奔跑。我的家乡不只有冰雪，还有覆盖山谷的青草，和疾行在群山之间的列车。这些，都是我记忆中的谢拉格。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/30/hra5tca7tcb4bp0543c660psouqltfh.mp3","text":"......来找我的时候，我总是在睡觉？不，我没有不舒服。我习惯了，连续工作好几天，然后倒头就睡，可能会睡得久一些。博士，只要听见你的声音，我一定醒来陪你。我没问题的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/jyynu1jrqj2snbf47i0pb528cz4zcwz.mp3","text":"博士，你见过极光吗？上学时，我在最北边的冰原上见过一次。很快，我生病了，只能离开科考团。如果我还能回去的话......博士，你愿不愿意和我一起看极光？","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/pniosyxfai8oox3krnrvtmeva5gg8tq.mp3","text":"博士，我的外套，给你。趴着睡觉，容易着凉。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/fr5dxst8qcnmquge3ha7hi24vaoyvi3.mp3","text":"博士，我是极光。可露希尔老大经常提起你。我答应她，会保护你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/3rdyhu5t81bussdhogawdhfzh8o9to8.mp3","text":"这是龙门战的作战记录？我学到了，原来盾牌还可以这么挥舞。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/pgbhr3abrsaho82hcdo8hh5arfuszv5.mp3","text":"Sharp队长......对我评价很高？你也同意吗？我......好高兴。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/jucytjwzdrjdixxyi4ctq0v9c0ujw3h.mp3","text":"这枚勋章，我能寄回家吗？我想让妈妈知道，虽然我染了病，但走出来并不只有坏处。我还在进步。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/32nlryfv9hhed2zephh9tlfye43d9i6.mp3","text":"又要出外勤任务吗？博士，我陪你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ca/6slwm7ki82p7p2pcaen8ycdylxlcy6x.mp3","text":"让我当队长？我......会尽力学习Sharp队长的指挥方式。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/do0fd7epwd2v8vd6es7dibnr4nophbn.mp3","text":"极光，出击。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/9j8a510uunfqrz60k00jq391p7txbu2.mp3","text":"你们，别再走近了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/g5f70ss0xl9r2pv7w6zab8j35lb54w4.mp3","text":"博士，请说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/54/ttvovy60sq452mw522t7uqvq5c0fejg.mp3","text":"等你下令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/5cn3kjc7rugby0883jsei0f09ohblcv.mp3","text":"这块地形很适合我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/azajzb8ninj2676yopwhzbisbicph7i.mp3","text":"一个敌人都别想通过。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/325wfdpec0eccjzamz17zk5xdusna6s.mp3","text":"故乡的雪......陪伴着我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/tskjr9k2j48znbr1jh9j1ky93zud7vs.mp3","text":"雪，让我的血沸腾。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/54/j5o9n7xob7ezbh4c5stp9hqyj8hdjhn.mp3","text":"雪，令敌人的血冻结。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/dqbqx1a53nfo1t07rkocj663w20i6jo.mp3","text":"雪，温暖我的家人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/s1y9unwsw92txhc34wgzg5r0ev64nao.mp3","text":"我会变得更强，让你赢得更轻松一点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/ssapza0tkmpptbfmcusint6vypyjj1w.mp3","text":"先不要靠近我......我的手太冰了。快速搓一搓会好一点......好、好了，现在可以击掌了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/dahrl3rubj918pwy1aie1c0iyd205ti.mp3","text":"下一次，我不会放过任何一个人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/f9ra4odmvsmj81od23k8puimf2okym0.mp3","text":"博士，我们需要尽快撤退！你还有力气吗？我背你走......不，抱你走也行！","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/q9dkskt67tkcm61qe9p0j9kt9dyqnee.mp3","text":"这间屋子，好热......","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/26/i230qltp6p798k0yi7k5ipcudhz6tkj.mp3","text":"饼、饼干，要撒到地上了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/33j4kcur1df9gzn6acidh284ho59elu.mp3","text":"......要出门吗？我来当你护卫。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/kawtv3aba8329xaaotcxrrzza7kaby3.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/erj8ewe3dqa6o9bbfyboyc09snte54l.mp3","text":"博士，新年快乐。但愿来年的每一片雪花在覆上大地的时候，都能变得更加温柔。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/lmaaqjgslwpkwk53wgyg9h8qvtxlun9.mp3","text":"博士，你好，有事请吩咐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_422_aurora/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/8nvz9flw6jaeua0bxxihgcs95yqv5cl.mp3","text":"只要是我能做的工作，都可以交给我。我来这里，就是为了让你多休息一下，博士。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/bbdkbfvfnbmdwzot2cs6nmraops37ws.mp3","text":"我的病，不算什么。偶尔很痛，但我能忍住。博士，我一定要继续工作。我不想让大家对我失望。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/63/dqms0hanm6v6b30wyzdiziu2dhvcf0q.mp3","text":"点心，都吃完了。啊......是博士一周的量？抱歉......下午茶的话，我来做奶酪火锅吧。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/gyz9p34ctgp7d6avijqrdsa0emy3k9e.mp3","text":"在走廊上撞见银灰老爷和圣女大人的时候，我还是会忍不住行礼。可是他们说，在罗德岛，我应该把他们当成同事。我......努力试试。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/rwqjnqa8ya81dgev65jcqevz7oozv6d.mp3","text":"我......做不了探险家。比起探索，我更想守护。桩子打下去，家园建起来。像你们这样不断前行的人，还是需要有人替你们守着后方阵地的吧？博士，我想做那个人。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/37/f89jfhsccgzee7odjfznx2thmhl9qw6.mp3","text":"银灰老爷说，谢拉格，不能永远依靠耶拉冈德，更不能依靠其他国家。我希望，有一天，我也能用手中的盾，为家人们抵挡风雪。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/a7qmdq2h5vlx70wu7rq57x4arhkp6rl.mp3","text":"我常常梦见雪山，梦见......我在结了厚冰的湖面上奔跑。我的家乡不只有冰雪，还有覆盖山谷的青草，和疾行在群山之间的列车。这些，都是我记忆中的谢拉格。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/09/9hy5eepebtlc725in7d8a1bgcjxhpwq.mp3","text":"......来找我的时候，我总是在睡觉？不，我没有不舒服。我习惯了，连续工作好几天，然后倒头就睡，可能会睡得久一些。博士，只要听见你的声音，我一定醒来陪你。我没问题的。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/08/eez2sfme8du1atqlwfk3f1y7ccqx91a.mp3","text":"博士，你见过极光吗？上学时，我在最北边的冰原上见过一次。很快，我生病了，只能离开科考团。如果我还能回去的话......博士，你愿不愿意和我一起看极光？","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/ihegh6v0b1pczhxrhk2te43c2d5d8cj.mp3","text":"博士，我的外套，给你。趴着睡觉，容易着凉。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/o2px75t34hj6w9tkn6oucwthh4k2cr0.mp3","text":"博士，我是极光。可露希尔老大经常提起你。我答应她，会保护你。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/9cxcgjybgqgvhrhspd25groxd3y9kpq.mp3","text":"这是龙门战的作战记录？我学到了，原来盾牌还可以这么挥舞。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/orxiyn64mxq7q306cs6n3pm46kzkd5i.mp3","text":"Sharp队长......对我评价很高？你也同意吗？我......好高兴。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/htm4jychebnj5x6gwaaiox3tynnga0c.mp3","text":"这枚勋章，我能寄回家吗？我想让妈妈知道，虽然我染了病，但走出来并不只有坏处。我还在进步。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/2pr9mjkjmntsk7mltvqthno6adu7vq7.mp3","text":"又要出外勤任务吗？博士，我陪你。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/5kguw1zpqoyczhwrk4w7h8yy58jhxpo.mp3","text":"让我当队长？我......会尽力学习Sharp队长的指挥方式。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/la41h5r0lli1d7gux1v54uuj6c7h01a.mp3","text":"极光，出击。","alt":"voice/char_422_aurora/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bw